Vikram and Betal: The Helpful Stranger (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100124

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a traveler walking through a forest,” said Betal. “He was tired and hungry.”

On the way, he met a stranger who offered him food and water.

The traveler was surprised but accepted the help.

After resting, the traveler continued his journey.

Later, the traveler reached a village and became very successful.

One day, he saw the same stranger in need of help.

This time, the traveler helped him with food and shelter.

The stranger smiled and said, “Kindness always comes back.”

Betal then asked, “Vikram, why did the traveler help the stranger?”

Vikram replied, “Because kindness given is kindness returned.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Kindness always comes back to you.
